<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Equitable/Iowa said started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Equitable/Iowa said started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of Equitable of Iowa Cos with a rating of market outperform, according to a Goldman source.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/8 to 46.</p>
</text>
